            "text": "{\"executive_summary\":\"During Fiscal Week 202719, total demand across the NA Federal Standard queue was 1525, which was significantly higher than the forecasted volume of 364.04. This indicates a large under-forecast. Because the forecast was generated independently for this queue, it became under-forecast. The large difference between actual and forecasted volumes suggests that the forecasting mechanism may not have accurately captured the demand pattern for this queue.\",\"kpi_status\":{\"metric\":\"Forecast Adherence\",\"adherence_pct\":-318.9,\"threshold_pct\":10.0,\"breached\":true,\"direction\":\"under_forecast\"},\"business_impact\":\"The under-forecast resulted in a significant shortfall in resource allocation, potentially impacting customer satisfaction and experience.\",\"ranked_root_causes\":[{\"rank\":1,\"cause_type\":\"systematic_forecast_bias\",\"title\":\"Systematic Forecast Bias\",\"explanation\":\"The chronic bias in the forecasting process, as indicated by the DERIVED_FEATURES, suggests that the forecast has consistently been under-estimating the demand. During Fiscal Week 202719, total demand across the NA Federal Standard queue was 1525, which was significantly higher than the forecasted volume of 364.04. This indicates a large under-forecast. Because the forecast was generated independently for this queue, it became under-forecast. The large difference between actual and forecasted volumes suggests that the forecasting mechanism may not have accurately captured the demand pattern for this queue.\",\"evidence\":[{\"text\":\"The actual offered volume was 1525, which is significantly higher than the forecasted volume of 364.04.\",\"source_field\":\"Actual_Offered\",\"value\":1525},{\"text\":\"The forecasted volume was lower than the usual level, as indicated by the DERIVED_FEATURES.\",\"source_field\":\"fcst_offered\",\"value\":364.04}],\"confidence_pct\":80,\"confidence_level\":\"High\",\"business_impact\":\"The under-forecast resulted in a significant shortfall in resource allocation, potentially impacting customer satisfaction and experience.\",\"recommended_action\":\"Review the forecasting process to identify and address the systematic bias.\",\"status\":\"Verified\"},{\"rank\":2,\"cause_type\":\"genuine_demand_event\",\"title\":\"Genuine Demand Event\",\"explanation\":\"The large difference between actual and forecasted volumes could be due to a genuine demand event that was not captured by the forecasting process. During Fiscal Week 202719, total demand across the NA Federal Standard queue was 1525, which was significantly higher than the forecasted volume of 364.04. This indicates a large under-forecast. Because the forecast was generated independently for this queue, it became under-forecast. The large difference between actual and forecasted volumes suggests that the forecasting mechanism may not have accurately captured the demand pattern for this queue.\",\"evidence\":[{\"text\":\"The actual offered volume was 1525, which is significantly higher than the forecasted volume of 364.04.\",\"source_field\":\"Actual_Offered\",\"value\":1525},{\"text\":\"The forecasted volume was lower than the usual level, as indicated by the DERIVED_FEATURES.\",\"source_field\":\"fcst_offered\",\"value\":364.04}],\"confidence_pct\":60,\"confidence_level\":\"Medium\",\"business_impact\":\"The under-forecast resulted in a significant shortfall in resource allocation, potentially impacting customer satisfaction and experience.\",\"recommended_action\":\"Investigate the cause of the genuine demand event and adjust the forecasting process accordingly.\",\"status\":\"Hypothesis - To be Validated\"}],\"skeptic_review\":[{\"cause\":\"Systematic Forecast Bias\",\"challenge\":\"Is the systematic bias due to a flaw in the forecasting process or an unusual demand pattern?\",\"verdict\":\"retained\",\"reason\":\"The chronic bias in the forecasting process, as indicated by the DERIVED_FEATURES, suggests that the forecast has consistently been under-estimating the demand.\"},{\"cause\":\"Genuine Demand Event\",\"challenge\":\"Is the genuine demand event a one-time occurrence or a recurring pattern?\",\"verdict\":\"retained\",\"reason\":\"The large difference between actual and forecasted volumes could be due to a genuine demand event that was not captured by the forecasting process.\"},{\"cause\":\"Systematic Forecast Bias\",\"challenge\":\"Is this supported by the data, or could something else explain it better?\",\"verdict\":\"retained\",\"reason\":\"The feature this cause depends on is present in the data and its quoted figures reconcile.\"},{\"cause\":\"Genuine Demand Event\",\"challenge\":\"Is this supported by the data, or could something else explain it better?\",\"verdict\":\"retained\",\"reason\":\"The feature this cause depends on is present in the data and its quoted figures reconcile.\"}],\"investigation_trail\":{\"levels_checked\":[\"Queue\"],\"inherited_from\":\"\",\"narrative\":\"The investigation started at the queue level and found that the under-forecast was not inherited from a higher level.\"},\"channel_migration\":{\"detected\":false,\"narrative\":\"No channel migration was detected.\",\"gaining_channels\":[],\"losing_channels\":[],\"grouped_by\":null,\"is_cqn_proxy\":null,\"combined_queue_names\":[],\"cqn_note\":null,\"detail\":{\"available\":false,\"reason\":\"No channel-sibling rows returned for this locality.\"}},\"technical_metrics\":[{\"label\":\"Forecast Offered\",\"value\":364.04},{\"label\":\"Actual_Offered\",\"value\":1525},{\"label\":\"Planned ASU\",\"value\":14239272},{\"label\":\"Forecast Error\",\"value\":1160.9627879}],\"missing_information\":[\"Actual_ASU\",\"CHANNEL_SIBLINGS\",\"INVESTIGATION_LADDER\",\"DATA_QUALITY\"],\"derived_features\":{\"base_features\":{\"chronic_bias\":{\"history_mean_adherence_pct\":12.2,\"typical_abs_deviation_pct\":12.5,\"history_weeks\":13,\"usual_forecast\":414.5,\"usual_actual\":364.5,\"consistent_directi